# Client-confidential material never goes in this repo.
# Real deliverables, decks and extracted text live outside it. Anonymize before committing any example.
_client-private/
*client*.pdf
*client*.pptx

# Real-deck material stays local: raw intake machinery (extracted client text, real
# filenames, drive inventory, sealed triage) AND the pseudonymised case files, which
# carry the full text of real client deliverables. Only the labeling kit, seeded-variant
# spec and READMEs are committed.
tools/quality-reviewer/v2/eval-cases-real/intake-work/
tools/quality-reviewer/v2/eval-cases-real/real-*.md
tools/quality-reviewer/v2/eval-cases-real/real-*.gold.md
# Labeling worksheets and gold carry real client deck content: local-only.
tools/quality-reviewer/v2/eval-cases-real/labeling/real-*.worksheet.*.md
tools/quality-reviewer/v2/eval-cases-real/labeling/real-*.gold.md
# Local case reader (renders real client decks): local-only.
tools/quality-reviewer/v2/eval-cases-real/_case-reader.html
# Labeling session record (per-case findings on real decks): local-only.
tools/quality-reviewer/v2/eval-cases-real/_LABELING-RECORD.md

# Local Cloudflare Wrangler build cache — not source.
website/variants/tools/.wrangler/

# Heavy binaries (decks, image dumps) are kept out to keep the repo lean.
*.pptx
slides_out/
*.tmp

# Branch Awards working files carry internal branch data (budgets, metrics, client
# names in aggregate) — local only, never pushed.
branch-awards/

# Website build secrets and reference material with unclear licensing
website/.env
website/moodboard/

# Local tooling
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.venv/

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/

# Note: small PDFs that are our own IP (evidence-base.pdf, methodology-evidence-base.pdf)
# are intentionally tracked. Client PDFs are not.

# Generated consolidated site tree (rebuilt by website/variants/tools/build-dist.mjs)
website/variants/dist/
